+### Follow-up: dc Crazy Taxi residual garbage/stale in GAMEPLAY (2026-07-17, live-play diagnosis — NO deploy yet)
+
+After the gc/F-Zero semaphore cure validated (Stuntman + F-Zero "seem fine now"), Eric reports **DC Crazy Taxi still shows the residual garbage/stale class in gameplay.** Root-caused to **"the gc bug WITHOUT the cure available"** — confirmed by live logs + flycast source:
